  (text "Sensor read-back on J4-J11: IO1 high tri-states U6, A0-A2 select the channel,\nIO0 (ADC1_CH0) reads it through R52/R53 (0-5 V -> 0-2 V). R51 keeps U6 on at boot." (at 180.34 172.72 0)
